WEBVTT

1
00:00:09.534 --> 00:00:18.226
Izzie could not believe her eyes.

2
00:00:18.227 --> 00:00:21.251
On the floor of the gym were hula hoops.

3
00:00:21.252 --> 00:00:23.180
Big hula hoops.

4
00:00:23.181 --> 00:00:25.136
Small hula hoops.

5
00:00:25.137 --> 00:00:28.589
Colorful hula hoops.

6
00:00:28.590 --> 00:00:32.937
"Miss Shelly! How did you know?" Izzie burst out.

7
00:00:32.938 --> 00:00:36.769
"Hi, Izzie. How did I know what?"

8
00:00:36.770 --> 00:00:38.825
Miss Shelly looked puzzled.

9
00:00:38.826 --> 00:00:42.916
"I love hula hoops!" Izzie said.

10
00:00:42.917 --> 00:00:46.895
"I got one for my birthday last week."

11
00:00:46.896 --> 00:00:50.660
"I didn't know. That's great.

12
00:00:50.661 --> 00:00:55.282
Today you'll learn some hula hoop games," Miss Shelly said.

13
00:00:55.283 --> 00:00:58.556
"Games?" Izzie frowned.

14
00:00:58.557 --> 00:01:05.513
"I like to just twirl it around my hips."

15
00:01:05.514 --> 00:01:09.692
"Put on your coats and grab a hoop," Miss Shelly said.

16
00:01:09.693 --> 00:01:18.509
Izzie grabbed a hoop with green and pink stripes.

17
00:01:18.510 --> 00:01:23.378
"The sky is so gray," Nina said, rubbing her hands.

18
00:01:23.379 --> 00:01:26.681
"Put down your hoops," Miss Shelly said.

19
00:01:26.682 --> 00:01:31.543
"Join hands and make a circle."

20
00:01:31.544 --> 00:01:36.278
Izzie sighed. When would they get to hula hoop?

21
00:01:36.279 --> 00:01:42.889
"For the first activity, we have to work as a team," Miss Shelly said.

22
00:01:42.890 --> 00:01:45.741
"Can I join here?"

23
00:01:45.742 --> 00:01:49.672
She stepped into the circle between Izzie and Jason.

24
00:01:49.673 --> 00:01:52.361
She joined hands with Jason.

25
00:01:52.362 --> 00:01:57.756
Before she took Izzie's hand, she put her arm through a hula hoop.

26
00:01:57.757 --> 00:02:01.478
"We're going to pass the hula hoop around the circle.

27
00:02:01.479 --> 00:02:06.613
But we can't let go of each other's hands," Miss Shelly said.

28
00:02:06.614 --> 00:02:11.762
"What? How will we pass it?" Izzie asked.

29
00:02:11.763 --> 00:02:13.944
Miss Shelly smiled.

30
00:02:13.945 --> 00:02:17.857
"You'll figure it out."

31
00:02:17.858 --> 00:02:20.430
Miss Shelly lowered her shoulder.

32
00:02:20.431 --> 00:02:23.727
The hula hoop slipped down to Izzie's left arm.

33
00:02:23.728 --> 00:02:25.864
Izzie put her head through it.

34
00:02:25.865 --> 00:02:28.549
Then she wriggled the rest of her body through.

35
00:02:28.550 --> 00:02:32.734
She stepped out of it and it was on her right arm!

36
00:02:32.735 --> 00:02:35.759
"I did it!" she squealed.

37
00:02:35.760 --> 00:02:39.904
"Nina, your turn!"

38
00:02:39.905 --> 00:02:43.648
Nina did what Izzie did.

39
00:02:43.649 --> 00:02:46.680
Soon the hoop was around Bobby's arm.

40
00:02:46.681 --> 00:02:49.153
Bobby moved it to Ethan.

41
00:02:49.154 --> 00:02:53.623
Ethan moved it to Jason, and Jason moved it to Miss Shelly.

42
00:02:53.624 --> 00:02:56.307
It made a full circle!

43
00:02:56.308 --> 00:02:59.368
"We did it!" Jason cried.

44
00:02:59.369 --> 00:03:02.207
Everyone cheered.

45
00:03:02.208 --> 00:03:06.837
"What did you have to do to stay together?" Miss Shelly asked.

46
00:03:06.838 --> 00:03:08.690
Bobby spoke up.

47
00:03:08.691 --> 00:03:12.003
"I had to watch whenever Nina moved.

48
00:03:12.004 --> 00:03:16.357
If she bent down, I had to bend down too."

49
00:03:16.358 --> 00:03:22.326
Izzie nodded. "The hardest part was not letting go of each other's hands.

50
00:03:22.327 --> 00:03:26.085
Now when do we get to hula hoop?" she asked.

51
00:03:26.086 --> 00:03:29.874
"Very soon," Miss Shelly said.

52
00:03:29.875 --> 00:03:32.885
"Roll your hula hoop on the blacktop.

53
00:03:32.886 --> 00:03:39.245
Wherever it lands, start hula hooping!"

54
00:03:39.246 --> 00:03:42.113
Izzie took off her jacket and shivered.

55
00:03:42.114 --> 00:03:46.640
She picked up her hoop and rolled it across the blacktop.

56
00:03:46.641 --> 00:03:48.882
Then she ran after it.

57
00:03:48.883 --> 00:03:53.620
When it stopped, she spun it around her waist.

58
00:03:53.621 --> 00:03:56.886
The hula hoop flew around and around.

59
00:03:56.887 --> 00:03:59.213
It was so much fun!

60
00:03:59.214 --> 00:04:02.301
She was in hula hooping heaven!

61
00:04:02.302 --> 00:04:04.212
She looked at Nina.

62
00:04:04.213 --> 00:04:06.620
She was hula hooping too.

63
00:04:06.621 --> 00:04:09.463
The boys kept dropping theirs though.

64
00:04:09.464 --> 00:04:12.755
Izzie felt like she could hula hoop forever.

65
00:04:12.756 --> 00:04:15.146
She looked up at the sky.

66
00:04:15.147 --> 00:04:17.169
It was getting dark.

67
00:04:17.170 --> 00:04:21.915
Suddenly something wet landed on her face.

68
00:04:21.916 --> 00:04:25.493
"Snowflakes!" Nina cried.

69
00:04:25.494 --> 00:04:27.640
It was starting to snow!

70
00:04:27.641 --> 00:04:31.563
"I've never seen real snow!" Ethan said.

71
00:04:31.564 --> 00:04:34.654
"Hooray!" Izzie cried.

72
00:04:34.655 --> 00:04:37.920
Snow was her favorite thing about winter.

73
00:04:37.921 --> 00:04:40.445
"Hooray for hula hoops!

74
00:04:40.446 --> 00:04:48.793
Hooray for hula hooping in the snow!"
